        "body": "Ouster, Inc. is a public company headquartered in San Francisco, California, traded under the ticker OUST. Its website describes it as a maker of digital lidar sensors, with the technology aimed at autonomy in vehicles, robotics, and smart cities, and at automation, drones, and robotics more broadly.\n\nThe site quotes Matt Reiland, Technical Director, Automation Innovation at Komatsu, on a partnership between the two companies. According to Reiland, Ouster's products developed through that partnership can withstand the shock, vibration and temperature constraints of harsh mining environments while delivering the enhanced range and spatial awareness needed to operate there.\n\nThe company's SEC filing record lists CIK 0001816581. No lawsuits are listed against it, and a litigation exposure count of 220 is recorded for California.",
